              },
              "changes": [
                "Source diff of the 1.6.0 and 1.6.1 sdists, downloaded and hashed on the Mac, nothing installed or run; the 1.6.0 hashes match the pin. No file added or removed; 37 files changed, most in sandbox.py, the CLI and the generated protos.",
                "Sandbox v2 calls send a per-sandbox token (x-modal-sandbox-token, from the create response) beside the auth token through a new _v2_metadata helper, including command router access.",
                "Experimental sidecars take include_oidc_identity_token and proxy, refused for GPU sandboxes. Server sessions retry start with an idempotency key for up to 25 minutes; the CLI gains endpoint commands; stats types gain container_total_count; agent detection reads tool variables before AGENT and AI_AGENT.",
                "Requirements: protobuf below 8.0 instead of 7.0, synchronicity ~=0.12.6 instead of ~=0.12.5. Some iterator return types become AsyncGenerator.",
                "No public Sandbox, ContainerProcess, Image, App or file method used by withruntime/modal was removed or renamed; that drop-in does not import modal. Installed consumer qualification is not run; the supported pin stays 1.6.0."
              ]
            }
          }
